<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>벙커 크로스핏 — CLASSIFIED // OPERATION BUNKER</title>
<meta name="description" content="벙커 크로스핏 · 1940년대 군사 작전 브리핑 스타일 데모 — 마포구 비밀 벙커에서 진행되는 12주 강화 작전." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Black+Ops+One&family=Saira+Stencil+One&family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#1c2118;
    --bg-deep:#141810;
    --panel:#232a1e;
    --panel-2:#2b3325;
    --lime:#c4d44a;
    --lime-dim:#9aa83b;
    --sand:#d8cda6;
    --sand-dim:#a89c78;
    --line:#4a5538;
    --line-soft:#3a432d;
    --stamp:#b23a2e;
    --warn:#ffb000;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--sand);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    line-height:1.6;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.035) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px),
      radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, rgba(196,212,74,0.05), transparent 60%);
  }
  ::selection{background:var(--lime);color:#11150c}
  a{color:inherit}
  h1,h2,h3,.stencil{font-family:'Saira Stencil One',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .blackops{font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif}
  .label{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.22em;font-weight:600}
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}

  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}

  /* ===== classified header strip ===== */
  .classbar{
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#11150c 0 14px,#1c2118 14px 28px);
    border-top:2px solid var(--lime);
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--lime);
    color:var(--lime);
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.34em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;
    padding:7px 0;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .classbar .run{display:inline-block;padding-left:100%;animation:march 22s linear infinite}
  .classbar .run span{margin:0 26px;text-shadow:0 0 1px #000}
  @keyframes march{to{transform:translateX(-100%)}}

  /* ===== generic stamp / corner ticks ===== */
  .stamp{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    border:3px solid var(--stamp);color:var(--stamp);
    font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;
    padding:8px 16px;transform:rotate(-9deg);
    text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:3px;opacity:.92;
    box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(178,58,46,.25);
  }
  .corner{position:relative}
  .corner::before,.corner::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid var(--lime-dim);
  }
  .corner::before{top:8px;left:8px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0}
  .corner::after{bottom:8px;right:8px;border-left:0;border-top:0}

  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .hero{position:relative;padding:54px 0 70px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
  .hero .doc{
    border:2px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg-deep));
    padding:34px clamp(20px,4vw,52px) 40px;position:relative;
  }
  .docmeta{
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;
    font-size:11px;color:var(--sand-dim);letter-spacing:.16em;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .docmeta b{color:var(--lime)}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem,9vw,6.2rem);line-height:.92;color:var(--sand);
    text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #11150c;margin:8px 0 6px;
  }
  .hero h1 .op{display:block;color:var(--lime);font-size:clamp(1rem,3.2vw,1.7rem);letter-spacing:.3em;margin-bottom:14px;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:700}
  .hero .tag{font-size:clamp(.95rem,2.2vw,1.15rem);color:var(--sand-dim);max-width:640px;margin-top:18px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .hero .tag b{color:var(--lime)}
  .hero-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:22px;margin-top:30px}
  .btn{
    display:inline-block;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 30px;font-size:14px;border-radius:2px;
    border:2px solid var(--lime);transition:.18s;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--lime);color:#11150c}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:#d6e85c;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(196,212,74,.25)}
  .btn-ghost{color:var(--lime);background:transparent}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:rgba(196,212,74,.12)}
  .hero .stamp{position:absolute;top:18px;right:18px;font-size:15px}
  .barcode{height:30px;width:160px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--sand) 0 2px,transparent 2px 4px,var(--sand) 4px 7px,transparent 7px 9px);opacity:.55}

  /* ===== section heads ===== */
  section{padding:64px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);position:relative}
  .shead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:34px}
  .shead .sect-no{font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;color:var(--lime);font-size:1rem;border:2px solid var(--lime-dim);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:3px}
  .shead h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,5vw,2.8rem);color:var(--sand)}
  .shead .en{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.26em;color:var(--sand-dim);font-size:12px;margin-left:auto;text-transform:uppercase}

  /* ===== operation cards (programs) ===== */
  .opgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:18px}
  .opcard{
    border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);padding:22px 20px 24px;position:relative;
    transition:.2s;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .opcard::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(196,212,74,.04) 0 8px,transparent 8px 16px);pointer-events:none}
  .opcard:hover{border-color:var(--lime);transform:translateY(-4px);background:var(--panel-2)}
  .opcard .code{font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;color:var(--lime);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.1em}
  .opcard h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin:10px 0 4px;color:var(--sand)}
  .opcard .sub{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;color:var(--sand-dim)}
  .opcard p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--sand-dim);margin:14px 0 16px;min-height:60px}
  .opcard .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);padding-top:12px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--lime-dim)}
  .opcard .meta b{color:var(--lime)}
  .diff{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;height:6px;width:100%;background:var(--line-soft);position:relative;border-radius:3px}
  .diff i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:var(--lime);border-radius:3px}

  /* ===== PHASE timeline ===== */
  .phases{position:relative;display:grid;gap:0}
  .phase{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:0;border-left:3px solid var(--line);
    position:relative;padding-bottom:8px;
  }
  .phase .pnum{
    position:relative;padding:18px 14px 28px 0;
  }
  .phase .pnum::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;left:-9px;top:24px;width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--bg);border:3px solid var(--lime);
  }
  .phase .pnum .big{font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;color:var(--lime);font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1}
  .phase .pnum .wk{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--sand-dim);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:6px}
  .phase .pbody{padding:18px 0 28px 26px}
  .phase .pbody h3{font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--sand);margin-bottom:6px}
  .phase .pbody .obj{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime-dim);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .phase .pbody p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--sand-dim);max-width:620px}
  .phase .pbody .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
  .phase .pbody .chips span{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 9px;color:var(--sand-dim);border-radius:2px}
  .phase:last-child{border-left-color:transparent}

  /* ===== map / AO ===== */
  .aogrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:26px;align-items:stretch}
  .mapbox{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg-deep);position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:340px}
  .maptag{position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--lime);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;z-index:2}
  .maptag-r{position:absolute;bottom:10px;right:12px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--sand-dim);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;z-index:2}
  .intel{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);padding:24px 22px}
  .intel h3{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--sand);margin-bottom:14px}
  .intel dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:10px 16px;font-size:12.5px}
  .intel dt{color:var(--lime-dim);letter-spacing:.1em;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px}
  .intel dd{color:var(--sand);text-align:right}
  .intel .note{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--sand-dim);letter-spacing:.04em}

  /* dashed flow */
  .flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:0;margin-top:34px;justify-content:center}
  .flow .node{border:2px dashed var(--line);padding:12px 18px;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;color:var(--sand);background:var(--panel)}
  .flow .node b{color:var(--lime)}
  .flow .arr{color:var(--lime);font-size:1.3rem;padding:0 12px}

  /* ===== pricing / membership ===== */
  .pricegrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:18px}
  .price{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);padding:26px 22px;position:relative}
  .price.featured{border-color:var(--lime);background:var(--panel-2)}
  .price.featured .rib{position:absolute;top:-2px;right:-2px;background:var(--lime);color:#11150c;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;padding:4px 12px}
  .price .rank{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime-dim);font-size:11px}
  .price h3{font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--sand);margin:6px 0 14px}
  .price .num{font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;color:var(--lime);font-size:2.2rem;line-height:1}
  .price .num small{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--sand-dim);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .price ul{list-style:none;margin:18px 0 22px;font-size:12.5px}
  .price li{padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line-soft);color:var(--sand-dim)}
  .price li::before{content:"▸ ";color:var(--lime)}
  .price .btn{width:100%;text-align:center}

  /* ===== ENLIST CTA ===== */
  .enlist{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-deep),var(--bg));text-align:center;position:relative}
  .enlist .doc{border:2px solid var(--lime);background:var(--panel);max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 28px 40px;position:relative}
  .enlist h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,7vw,3.6rem);color:var(--sand);text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #11150c}
  .enlist h2 span{color:var(--lime)}
  .enlist p{color:var(--sand-dim);max-width:520px;margin:16px auto 26px;font-size:13px}
  .enlist .stamp{margin-top:10px;font-size:13px}
  .tear{height:0;border-top:2px dashed var(--line);margin:34px 0;position:relative}
  .tear::after{content:"✂ — — — — 절취선 — — — —";position:absolute;left:50%;top:-10px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--bg);padding:0 12px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--sand-dim)}

  /* ===== contact / footer ===== */
  .contactgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:8px}
  .cblock{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px;background:var(--panel)}
  .cblock .label{color:var(--lime-dim);font-size:11px;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
  .cblock .v{color:var(--sand);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .cblock .v.big{font-family:'Saira Stencil One',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--lime)}
  footer{padding:40px 0 70px;text-align:center;color:var(--sand-dim);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em}
  footer .blackops{color:var(--sand);font-size:1.3rem;display:block;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:.08em}

  @media (max-width:720px){
    .aogrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .phase{grid-template-columns:90px 1fr}
    .intel dd{text-align:left}
    .flow{flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
    .flow .arr{transform:rotate(90deg);padding:6px 0}
    .hero .stamp{position:static;display:inline-flex;margin-top:18px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
  <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
  <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 09 · 벙커 크로스핏 — 1940년대 군사 작전 브리핑 스타일</span>
  <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
</div>
<div style="height:40px;"></div>

<!-- classified marquee -->
<div class="classbar">
  <div class="run">
    <span>CLASSIFIED // OPERATION BUNKER</span><span>★ EYES ONLY ★</span><span>FILE NO. BNK-1947-CF</span><span>AUTHORIZATION: COMMAND</span><span>DO NOT DISTRIBUTE</span><span>CLASSIFIED // OPERATION BUNKER</span><span>★ EYES ONLY ★</span><span>FILE NO. BNK-1947-CF</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== HERO / BRIEFING COVER ===== -->
<header class="hero corner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="doc">
      <div class="docmeta">
        <span>문서등급 <b>1급기밀</b> · TOP SECRET</span>
        <span>좌표 37°33′12″N 126°54′41″E</span>
        <span>발효 <b>0600 HRS</b> / D-DAY</span>
        <span>섹터 마포구 · ZONE-7</span>
      </div>

      <span class="label" style="color:var(--lime-dim);font-size:12px">▣ 작전 명령서 — 신병 강화 프로그램</span>
      <h1>
        <span class="op">OPERATION · BUNKER</span>
        벙커<br>크로스핏
      </h1>
      <p class="tag">
        편안함은 적이다. <b>마포구 지하 벙커</b>에 구축된 12주 강화 작전 시설.
        WOD·근력·컨디셔닝을 <b>미션 단위</b>로 분해하고, 민간인을 작전 가능 상태로 재편성한다.
        지원 자격: 변하기로 결심한 자.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-row">
        <a href="#enlist" class="btn btn-primary">▸ ENLIST · 입대 신청</a>
        <a href="#phases" class="btn btn-ghost">작전 개요 보기</a>
        <div class="barcode" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <span class="stamp">CLASSIFIED</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ===== SECTION 1 · PROGRAMS AS OPERATIONS ===== -->
<section id="ops">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead">
      <span class="sect-no">SEC.01</span>
      <h2>작전 분류 / 프로그램</h2>
      <span class="en">// MISSION CATALOG</span>
    </div>

    <div class="opgrid">
      <article class="opcard">
        <div class="code">OP-A · DAILY</div>
        <h3>WOD 돌격</h3>
        <div class="sub">Workout Of the Day</div>
        <p>매일 갱신되는 60분 합동 작전. 바벨·로잉·박스점프로 구성된 고강도 회로. 동료와 함께 전선을 돌파한다.</p>
        <div class="diff"><i style="width:90%"></i></div>
        <div class="meta"><span>강도 <b>HIGH</b></span><span>60 MIN</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="opcard">
        <div class="code">OP-B · STRENGTH</div>
        <h3>근력 진지</h3>
        <div class="sub">Strength Division</div>
        <p>스쿼트·데드리프트·클린 중심의 5×5 화력 증강. 정확한 자세로 최대 중량을 안전하게 점령한다.</p>
        <div class="diff"><i style="width:75%"></i></div>
        <div class="meta"><span>강도 <b>MID-HIGH</b></span><span>50 MIN</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="opcard">
        <div class="code">OP-C · CONDITION</div>
        <h3>컨디셔닝 기동</h3>
        <div class="sub">Conditioning Maneuver</div>
        <p>심폐 지구력 강화 작전. 인터벌·메트콘으로 체력 한계선을 후퇴시킨다. 땀은 평시 흘리는 피다.</p>
        <div class="diff"><i style="width:82%"></i></div>
        <div class="meta"><span>강도 <b>HIGH</b></span><span>45 MIN</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="opcard">
        <div class="code">OP-D · RECRUIT</div>
        <h3>입문 신병교육</h3>
        <div class="sub">Recruit Onboarding</div>
        <p>장비 사용·기본 동작·안전 수칙을 4회에 걸쳐 습득하는 기초군사훈련. 경험 무관, 0부터 시작.</p>
        <div class="diff"><i style="width:40%"></i></div>
        <div class="meta"><span>강도 <b>ENTRY</b></span><span>40 MIN</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SECTION 2 · 12-WEEK PHASES ===== -->
<section id="phases">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead">
      <span class="sect-no">SEC.02</span>
      <h2>12주 강화 작전 / 단계</h2>
      <span class="en">// PHASE TIMELINE</span>
    </div>

    <div class="phases">
      <div class="phase">
        <div class="pnum"><div class="big">P1</div><div class="wk">WEEK 01–03</div></div>
        <div class="pbody">
          <h3>정찰 · 기초 침투</h3>
          <div class="obj">OBJECTIVE — 지형 파악 · 동작 학습</div>
          <p>신체 현황을 정밀 측정하고, 기본 7대 동작을 군더더기 없이 장착한다. 부상 없이 전선에 적응하는 것이 본 단계의 유일한 목표다.</p>
          <div class="chips"><span>InBody 측정</span><span>기본 동작</span><span>가동성</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="phase">
        <div class="pnum"><div class="big">P2</div><div class="wk">WEEK 04–06</div></div>
        <div class="pbody">
          <h3>화력 증강 · 진지 구축</h3>
          <div class="obj">OBJECTIVE — 근력 베이스 구축</div>
          <p>주 3회 근력 진지 투입. 점진적 과부하로 기초 화력을 끌어올린다. 무게는 거짓말하지 않는다 — 기록이 전과(戰果)다.</p>
